      "date": "2026-05-21T12:09:06.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹26.26 (vs ₹28.53 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹26.26 (down from ₹28.53 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹17.0b (up 2.8% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹840.4m (down 8.0% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 5.0% (down from 5.5% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 85% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 5% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
