      "date": "2026-02-16T11:29:01.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹5.11 (vs ₹6.57 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹5.11 (down from ₹6.57 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹4.32b (up 4.8% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹163.5m (down 22% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 3.8% (down from 5.1% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 99% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 10% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
