      "title": "Kse Limited Declares First Interim Dividend for the Financial Year 2025-26, Payable on or Before 16 March 2026",
      "body": "Kse Limited announced at the board meeting held on February 14, 2026, Declared 1st interim dividend of INR 5 per equity share having face value of INR 1/- each for the financial year 2025-26. The Interim Dividend would be paid to members whose names appear on the Register of Members as on the Record Date i.e. 21.02.2026. The dividend shall be paid on or before 16th March 2026.",
